# fuzz.nat.1 (known; lane 120 fixes it in #355): a field compound assignment (p.a += 1) traps at the field name's column natively (6:7) but at the operator's column in ail run (6:9). Owner: lane 120 (structs); compiler/mir/lower.ail lower_assign passes mpos, not pos, to assign_member.
struct P
    a int

fn main()
    mut p := P(a: 9223372036854775807)
    p.a += 1
    print(p.a)
